{"repositoryId":1159608478,"availability":"available","full":"germanfndez/fiveai-skills","name":"fiveai-skills","description":"Curated FiveM (cfx.re) skills for AI assistants.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":17,"forks":3,"created":"2026-02-16T23:44:03Z","updated":"2026-09-13T15:43:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://usefiveai.vercel.app/skills","topics":[],"demo":"https://usefiveai.vercel.app/skills","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.396Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.396Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.396Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.396Z","stars":17,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Curated skills for FiveM (cfx.re) that give AI assistants and code agents accurate, up-to-date knowledge about the FiveM ecosystem. Use them in Cursor, VS Code, Claude Code, or any tool that supports skill/rule files. Each skill has a guide with common mistakes, install steps and FAQ at usefiveai.vercel.app/skills.","FiveM is a modification framework for Grand Theft Auto V that lets you run custom multiplayer servers with their own game modes, scripts, and assets. It’s part of the cfx.re platform (along with RedM for Red Dead Redemption 2). Servers are built with Lua (and optionally JavaScript/C#): resources, client/server scripts, events, and a rich ecosystem of libraries and frameworks (e.g. Ox, ESX, QBCore). If you’re building or maintaining a FiveM server or resource, these skills help your AI assistant speak the same language as the platform.","A skill is a bundle of documentation and rules that an AI uses when helping you with a specific topic. For example:"],"features":["lua-basics — Effective Lua programming for FiveM: functions, tables, variables, conditionals, error handling, best practices.","fivem-basics — Resource structure, fxmanifest.lua, client/server scripting, events, exports, debugging, and optimization.","fivem-nui — FiveM NUI (New User Interface): HTML/CSS/JS, fullscreen UIs, NUI callbacks, messaging.","fivem-security — Security & Anti-Exploit: Server authority, event validation, distance checks, rate limiting.","esx-framework — ESX Legacy: PlayerData, xPlayer, jobs, economy, inventory, weapons, events, callbacks, best practices."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/germanfndez/fiveai-skills/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d66aa1fbe35157c5540d8f7299fbdd07d00ef7f33e062ac3945bd382b9d963bd","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.506Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.506Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Curated skills for FiveM (cfx.re) that give AI assistants and code agents accurate, up-to-date knowledge about the FiveM ecosystem. Use them in Cursor, VS Code, Claude Code, or any tool that supports skill/rule files. Each skill has a guide with common mistakes, install steps and FAQ at usefiveai.vercel.app/skills.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/germanfndez/fiveai-skills/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d66aa1fbe35157c5540d8f7299fbdd07d00ef7f33e062ac3945bd382b9d963bd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/germanfndez/fiveai-skills/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.506Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-13T15:43:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/germanfndez/fiveai-skills/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:36.507Z","hash":"d66aa1fbe35157c5540d8f7299fbdd07d00ef7f33e062ac3945bd382b9d963bd","originalBytes":11705,"storedBytes":11705,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["skills","fiveai-skills","plugin","fivem","add","skill","fiveai","when","cursor","germanfndez","marketplace","rules","install","plugins","codex","server","update","hermes","powershell","code","community","profile","repository","cfx.re","local","run","skill.md","bundle","claude","events","how","inventory","npx","open","remove","scripts","web","agent","best","call